ines everywhere else","name":"Rules & dividers"},{"path":"guidelines/logo.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Raster monogram + tracked-caps wordmark","name":"Logo lockup"},{"path":"guidelines/motion.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"Slow entrances, 140ms feedback, no bounce","name":"Motion"},{"path":"guidelines/scrims.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"Imagery is never bare under text","name":"Protection gradients"},{"path":"guidelines/color-accents.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Teal for AI, violet for experiments, blue for engineering","name":"Secondary accents"},{"path":"guidelines/color-gold.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Molten gold, the single brand primary","name":"Gold — primary"},{"path":"guidelines/color-neutrals.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"Near-black page through to near-white text","name":"Ink — neutrals"},{"path":"guidelines/color-semantic-surfaces.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Panels separate by value step, not by shadow","name":"Semantic surfaces"},{"path":"guidelines/color-semantic-text.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"Text runs cool grey; pure white is display-only","name":"Semantic text"},{"path":"guidelines/color-taxonomy.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Tag color is meaningful — it names the taxonomy","name":"Category taxonomy"},{"path":"components/cards/cards.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x420","subtitle":"Project, article, pillar, value, quote and stat surfaces","name":"Cards"},{"path":"components/core/core.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"Buttons, tags, eyebrows, display type, rules, icons","name":"Core"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x360","subtitle":"Fields, search, caps select, subscribe bar",